    "done_when": "A test arms a stub producer whose RECKON_HOME lies in a tree pruned before session end, and asserts that the session-end path signals it. It fails at the base revision, where the mirrored record's derived home never matches. If the mirror is removed instead, the evidence fragment states the measurement that shows it had nothing to do. tests/conftest.py's users (tests/test_a_sweep_thread_ends_with_its_test.py and the watch and reap tests) are recorded as flat baseline_suite and after_suite records.",
